# What ui_accbox.steps left on its disk (--keep-disk), after the machine has started
# again: the order and the switch of the menu as they were set. Then the 小物箱's
# program as an application: its template in the 原紙箱.
accpos btron-backup
want ok 0 24 -
accpos tessronos-userenv
want ok 1 24 +
accpos console
want ok 21 24 +
accpos ut-acc
want ok 23 24 +
refs 01a0d8c4-5500-7f04-8b12-3c4d5e6f7b73
want ok 2
# the 原紙箱's program run: the system's 原紙箱, with the 小物箱's template in its last row
open 01a0d6d1-08d4-7809-bc38-c7d99aa28f29
wait 2000
win 原紙箱
want ok 893 35 1093 635
wait 800
shot ab_genshi
absent !OACV!
